<title>GERMANY: Germany's ProSieben, to list soon, ups 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Germany's ProSieben, to list soon, ups 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>UNTERFOEHRING, Germany 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			 169	 vs 96</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities  178	 vs 111</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax return on sales (pct) 10	 vs 7.6</p>
<p>    Group sales			    1,692	 vs 1,467</p>
<p>    Group equity			     334	 vs 164</p>
<p>    Group workforce			1,170	 vs 928</p>
<p>NOTE - Television station ProSieben Media AG is currently owned outright by Thomas Kirch and the Rewe retail group, but will be listed on the Frankfurt stock market in July.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
